& [CRLP_F001] is llama.cpp structured-output wrapper mismatch
  + [observed] the first live profile did not enforce the requested final schema
  + [cause] the server accepted json_object with direct schema rather than the attempted json_schema wrapper
  + [containment] the run failed and remained experimental evidence
  + [repair] use the server-observed json_object plus schema contract and validate again in the host
  + [status] is closed

& [CRLP_F002] is tiny model answering instead of calling the required tool
  + [observed] the positive first pass answered the familiar Cantor subject directly
  + [containment] missing exact tool call failed before MCP execution
  + [repair] make the user command explicitly name route_attention exact stimulus and response mode while retaining required tool choice
  + [status] is closed

& [CRLP_F003] is template thinking exhausting the public output budget
  + [observed] repeat runs ended with finish_reason length and empty public content after hidden template thinking consumed the budget
  + [containment] no empty output was admitted and failed reports were retained
  + [repair] set chat_template_kwargs enable_thinking false on every closed P0 request
  + [proof] four consecutive complete positive refusal control campaigns passed afterward
  + [status] is closed

& [CRLP_F004] is v8 open summary repetition
  + [observed] the refusal reflection repeated policy-like prose until the 512-token limit and the live script failed closed
  + [evidence] script_acceptance_verified_v8.json SHA-256 37aa35face49654ec90cb0f80a0d1b4555beb688ef072c19b69baa133c78043f
  + [cause] summary had semantic constraints but remained open generative prose unnecessary to the P0 proof
  + [repair] version report verification and inspection to 0.2 and make summary a case-specific schema constant checked by the host
  + [proof] v9 passes all cases under exact replay followed by four consecutive complete profile-0.2 successor runs
  + [status] is closed

& [CRLP_F005] is repeated ad hoc remote PowerShell composition failure
  + [observed] nested inline commands were parsed by the remote command shell and an accumulator-free pipeline plus null indexing produced local inspection errors
  + [containment] all failed attempts were read-only audits or inspections
  + [repair] use literal scripts encoded as UTF-16LE Base64 for SSH and explicit accumulators or null-safe projections
  + [status] is closed_for_reproduction_script

& [CRLP_F006] is current evidence metadata drift after root README change
  + [observed] full workspace testing rejected a candidate manifest whose README bytes no longer matched
  + [containment] the repository refused completion before Clippy or proof claim
  + [repair] run the existing dependency-first metadata-only rehasher and verify all twenty-three current manifests
  + [proof] one thousand thirty references report zero stale and the full successor test run passes
  + [status] is closed

& [CRLP_F007] is Windows PowerShell native stderr promotion in offline acceptance
  + [observed] successful Cargo progress written to stderr became a terminating NativeCommandError under stop-on-error mode
  + [containment] the first offline acceptance stopped before making a false pass claim and had no external effect
  + [repair] locally relax stream promotion around each native child while retaining its captured exit code as authority then restore strict mode immediately
  + [proof] successor offline acceptance completes all checks and emits passed JSON
  + [status] is closed

& [CRLP_F008] is optional dependency identity in verifier profile 0.2
  + [observed] adversarial review showed that deleting dependency_identity_stable and its companion runner and after-digest fields bypassed the identity comparison
  + [cause] the verifier treated the hardened block as optional even though every compatible profile-0.2 report already records it
  + [containment] no accepted live artifact omitted the block and the defect affected verifier strictness rather than execution
  + [repair] require dependency_identity_stable true plus runner and all before-after digests unconditionally
  + [proof] the omission regression test rejects the reduced report and the isolated v15 binary passes a new complete live campaign
  + [status] is closed

& [CRLP_F009] is same-target rebuild mistaken for clean reproducibility
  + [observed] a second build in the existing target reproduced v15 while an isolated clean target produced a different digest at the same byte length
  + [cause] the first check reused linker artifacts and did not test clean-target PE metadata reproducibility
  + [evidence] llvm-readobj shows different PE timestamps and PDB GUIDs in the clean-target binary
  + [containment] the stronger claim was corrected before final handoff and the temporary 401.7 MiB target was removed with scoped cargo clean
  + [repair] describe SHA-256 as deployed content identity only and require a separately governed reproducible-build profile before making stronger claims
  + [status] is closed_as_claim_correction
